  "details": "Add an \"edit mode\" or similar to the camera to allow dragging to rearrange the buttons in the expanded menu instead of scrolling side to side. This would allow users to put more frequently used features towards the front of the queue, instead of having to scroll to access them each time the camera is used. Ex: being able to drag the Focus button closer to the shutter and timer buttons would make it faster and easier for artistic photos to be taken.",
